‹Heading1,b:Gleam›
‹Rule:────────────────────›

Gleam turns a folder
of Markdown into a
site. It has ‹Text,b:no›
‹Text,b:runtime›, reads a
single ‹Link,u:config file›,
and builds a
thousand pages in
under a second. See
the ‹Link,u:changelog› and
the ‹Link,u:contributing›
‹Link,u:guide›.

‹Image:󰥶 A screenshot of t…›

