‹Heading2,b:Usage›

  ‹Bullet:1. ›Create
     ‹Code: gleam.toml ›
  ‹Bullet:2. ›Put pages in
     ‹Code: content/ ›
  ‹Bullet:3. ›Run ‹Code: gleam›
     ‹Code:build ›

